  "details": "I have a group that is set to Request Invite so I can scan over the users, I've have had to reject many, many applications because the user is at their group cap (200/200vrc+)\n\nTalking to some of them, they get no error that pops up when attempting to request on the group.\n\nSome may not have had max groups when they joined, and none seem to receive errors and are therefore unaware as to why they were unable to get in.\n\nA good resolution/fix would be implementing a warning for the user requesting they are unable to join at this time due to hitting their group cap limit.\n\nI noticed this issue has previous bugs/issues that were tracked about this topic here:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1270-bug-website-failed-to-accept-join-request-for-users-at-100-groups\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/warn-users-if-they-are-maxxed-out-on-groups-when-requesting-to-join-a-group",
